title = "Thunder Point Campaign (TSE)"

[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
<center><h2>Thunder Point Campaign (The Sameron Era)</h2>
<P>~B~iHistroy:~w<P>
The Sameron faith was once a great power for good in the land of Nimbus.  But with this power 
came corruption and the rise of Martol, the seer.  Martol rose through the brotherhood until he 
became the high priest of Terra, the northern Island.  In Terra, Martol plotted against 
his fellow brothern and had most of them assasinated before he was linked to their deaths.  By this time it was too late to stop Martol, 
he had a firm grip on Nimbus. 
<P>~B~iPresent:~w<P>
The last of faithful high priests have been captured after months of fighting, and 
are now in route to Terra for public execution.
<P><a href="http://www.geocities.com/TimesSquare/Ring/8655/">Visit Thunder Point</a>
<P><a href="mailto:JR@upb.byu.edu">Email: jrc</a>

